Source: vajra-sources
Section: admin
Priority: important
Maintainer: Vajra OS Team <packages@vajra-os.org>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.5.0
Homepage: https://vajra-os.org

Package: vajra-sources
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, vajra-keyring
Description: Vajra OS APT sources.list configuration
 Configures apt to use the Vajra OS package repository.
 Installs /etc/apt/sources.list.d/vajra.list pointing to the Vajra OS
 repository with GPG signature verification via the vajra-keyring package.
 .
 After installation, users can run 'apt update' to fetch the Vajra OS
 package catalog and install Vajra tools with 'apt install vajra-*'.
